cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, cite the software release."
title: "RASGAN: Physics-Aware Flow-Field Reconstruction in TensorFlow"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - family-names: "Eduku"
    given-names: "Kaku E."
abstract: >-
  TensorFlow implementation of a conditional relativistic GAN for reconstructing
  three-channel flow fields from lower-fidelity or POD-reconstructed inputs.
  The software includes RRDB/ECA, Transformer, and composite generators; a
  conditional spectral PatchGAN discriminator; physics- and spectrum-aware
  losses; staged training; EMA/checkpoint support; and a synthetic smoke test.
keywords:
  - generative adversarial network
  - TensorFlow
  - flow-field reconstruction
  - scientific machine learning
  - super-resolution
  - proper orthogonal decomposition
